1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,760
Venha descobrir

2
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:01,960
se você aguentaria ser

3
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:02,680
um pirata.

4
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:03,800
Você tem vinte anos,

5
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:04,580
jurou as regras

6
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:04,940
do navio

7
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:06,020
e bate o biscoito

8
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:06,400
do jantar

9
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,180
na mesa pros carunchos caírem.

10
00:00:08,497 --> 00:00:09,937
Você começa de marujo:

11
00:00:09,937 --> 00:00:11,377
dorme colado no vizinho,

12
00:00:11,377 --> 00:00:12,757
entre piolho e rato,

13
00:00:12,757 --> 00:00:13,617
e bebe rum,

14
00:00:13,617 --> 00:00:14,937
porque a água apodrece.

15
00:00:15,328 --> 00:00:16,308
Sem carne,

16
00:00:16,308 --> 00:00:17,048
o cozinheiro frita

17
00:00:17,048 --> 00:00:17,828
o que sobra:

18
00:00:17,828 --> 00:00:18,508
a tripulação

19
00:00:18,508 --> 00:00:19,628
de Henry Morgan comeu

20
00:00:19,628 --> 00:00:21,008
uma bolsa de couro.

21
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:22,150
O músico,

22
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:22,710
muitas vezes,

23
00:00:22,710 --> 00:00:23,290
foi capturado

24
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:24,050
de outro navio

25
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:24,670
e obrigado

26
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:26,290
a tocar violino no ataque,

27
00:00:26,290 --> 00:00:27,384
pra assustar.

28
00:00:27,384 --> 00:00:28,304
Nos canhões,

29
00:00:28,304 --> 00:00:29,084
quem grita fogo é

30
00:00:29,084 --> 00:00:29,884
o artilheiro.

31
00:00:29,884 --> 00:00:30,164
Só que

32
00:00:30,164 --> 00:00:31,764
o outro navio também atira.

33
00:00:32,109 --> 00:00:33,069
Sem médico,

34
00:00:33,069 --> 00:00:33,749
quem opera você é

35
00:00:33,749 --> 00:00:34,389
o carpinteiro,

36
00:00:34,389 --> 00:00:35,789
com a serra da madeira.

37
00:00:35,789 --> 00:00:36,989
Por um braço perdido,

38
00:00:36,989 --> 00:00:37,429
as regras

39
00:00:37,429 --> 00:00:38,549
que você jurou pagam

40
00:00:38,549 --> 00:00:39,829
oitocentas moedas.

41
00:00:40,138 --> 00:00:41,678
Quem paga é o quartel-mestre,

42
00:00:41,678 --> 00:00:42,498
que divide o tesouro

43
00:00:42,498 --> 00:00:43,418
e, fora da batalha,

44
00:00:43,418 --> 00:00:44,658
manda igual ao capitão.

45
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,340
E o capitão?

46
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:47,600
É eleito e derrubado

47
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:48,140
no voto,

48
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:49,760
pelas regras que você jurou.

49
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:50,700
Se o navio é pego,

50
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:51,580
o cargo mais alto

51
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:53,456
sobe primeiro na forca.

52
00:00:53,456 --> 00:00:54,036
E aí,

53
00:00:54,036 --> 00:00:54,916
você teria coragem

54
00:00:54,916 --> 00:00:55,836
de ser um tripulante

55
00:00:55,836 --> 00:00:56,916
de um navio pirata?
